# A Pongal Feast!

History continually tells us that the journey towards an ideal does not proceed across soft green grass; to see a life of liberation, one must cross thorny thickets and heaps of stone that inflict great pain. Having read those histories and witnessed their truth in experience, I behold with delight the heroic people who, without fear, have dedicated themselves to the country's liberation. That itself is my Pongal feast.

I would say *Murasoli* is one of the powerful weapons given to those warriors of liberation.

Year after year, its annual acquires new distinction and beauty and delights Tamils. It beats the drum of principle and sings the melody of liberation. It encourages our people to answer proudly, "Here, behold our journal!" to those who have claimed that they alone possess the ability to publish an attractive journal.

Through this colourful annual, I convey my affectionate Pongal greetings to the people of Tamil Nadu.

Annadurai

(Pongal Annual, 14-1-28; *Murasoli*)
